@Blog.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7000

### List published posts
GET {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/posts
Accept: application/json

### Get a post by slug
GET {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/posts/hello-world
Accept: application/json

### Create a post (SuperAdmin bearer token required)
POST {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>

{
  "title": "Hello world",
  "content": "# Hello\n\nThis is **markdown**.",
  "published": true
}
